  "productSlug": "openphone",
  "shortDescription": "OpenPhone (rebranded Quo in 2025; product surface unchanged) is a modern shared business phone for SMB teams: one local or toll-free number per user, unlimited US/Canada calling and SMS under fair use, shared inboxes, and Sona AI answering. Starter $15, Business $23 and Scale $35 per user/month annual ($19/$33/$47 monthly) were confirmed on openphone.com/pricing 2026-08-17. Phone menus, automatic recording and deeper CRM (HubSpot/Salesforce) land on Business+; Scale adds AI call tags and dedicated onboarding. Fair-use policy prohibits cold calling and auto-dialers \u2014 not a power-dialer product.",
